{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00594","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第五章 · 姜皎","name":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第五章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙池初出此龙山，常经此地谒龙颜。\n日日芙蓉生夏水，年年杨柳变春湾。\n尧坛宝匣余烟雾，舜海渔舟尚往还。\n愿似飘颻五云影，从来从去九天间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姜皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}